# Assistant working notes. Untracked from 2026-09-03 for the public release;
# the full history is still in git, so the constraints this repo was built
# under stay auditable. STATE.md is the record that stays tracked.
CLAUDE.md

# Packaged skill zip (the live copy is .claude/commands/anti-ai.md)
.claude/anti-ai.skill

# Summer-school binaries (kept locally, not tracked). Do NOT add *.pdf —
